%% NORMAL_RUNTIME — steady-state operation (06 §1e)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Observing: app start (STARTUP §1)
    Observing: region calm/idle · telemetry ≤1 Hz · triggers armed
    Observing --> TransitionBoost: lifecycle launch/switch event
    TransitionBoost: CS-1 bounded boost (if admitted) · expiry timer armed
    TransitionBoost --> Observing: boost expired + readback ok
    Observing --> PressureRising: PSI some-trigger sustained ≥ dwell
    PressureRising: continuity intents (CS-3/CS-2 if admitted) · regression guard armed
    PressureRising --> Observing: pressure subsides (counter-persistence)
    PressureRising --> PressureCritical: PSI full stalls rising
    PressureCritical: protective stance only — FixHUA never kills; continuity intents stopped
    PressureCritical --> PressureRising: pressure easing
    Observing --> ThermalShaping: thermal trend hot (E-08 lead)
    ThermalShaping: CS-8 advisory — own boosts off, warming stopped, bg deprio if admitted
    ThermalShaping --> Observing: trend cooled
    note right of Observing
        All transitions journaled.
        Governor enforces dwell/rate/energy on every edge.
    end note
